  triage:title "cargo fmt regression: import ordering in boundary/mod.rs" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-core/src/boundary/mod.rs — cargo fmt --check fails due to import ordering regression introduced by fix-R1. Extra imports (use crate::schema::AtmMessageId and use std::path::Path) were inserted inline, interleaving pub use with use blocks and violating rustfmt's import grouping rules." ;
